<section class="about-feature about-intro"><div class="wrap"><div class="about-intro-heading"><div class="eyebrow">MEET RIPL</div><h1 class="about-title">You’ve built something meaningful.<span class="about-title-highlight">Let’s bring your financial life together.</span></h1></div><div class="about-intro-row"><div class="editorial-image"><img src="/images/ripl-home-team.jpg" alt="The RIPL team in their Fort Collins office" width="1536" height="1024"/></div><div class="about-copy"><p>Your business, family, taxes, and investments are connected. We help you see how they fit together, organize what needs attention, and make decisions with greater clarity.</p><p>Meet the people who help turn that clarity into a plan, and keep it moving.</p><a class="text-link about-team-link" href="#ripl-team">Meet Your Team ↓</a></div></div></div></section><section class="section about-decisions"><div class="wrap split"><h2>Every decision<br/>stays with you.</h2><div class="about-decisions-copy"><figure class="about-chase-quote"><blockquote>“Smart people make excellent decisions when they can see all of their options.”</blockquote><figcaption>Chase Bellefeuille <span>· Founder</span></figcaption></figure><p>Our role is to help you see those options, understand the tradeoffs, and choose what fits your life.</p><p>You get a team, a coordinated process, and people who know your situation. Serious work, clear explanations, and room to enjoy the relationship.</p></div></div></section><section class="section questions" id="ripl-team"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">YOUR TEAM</div><h2>Real people.<br/>Working together.</h2><div class="team-grid"><article><img src="/images/chase-team-office.png" alt="Chase Bellefeuille" loading="lazy"/><h3>Chase Bellefeuille</h3><span class="team-role">Founder</span><p>The thinking and philosophy behind RIPL. Connects the vision for your life with the strategy for your wealth.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://calendly.com/chase-riplwealth/talk-to-the-founder" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Book with Chase</a><a class="team-bio-link" href="/team/chase-bellefeuille/">Learn More About Chase <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></article><article><div class="team-portrait team-portrait-adam"><img src="/images/adam-team-office.png" alt="Adam Kasick" loading="lazy"/></div><h3>Adam Kasick</h3><span class="team-role">Wealth Manager</span><p>A business-owner perspective on organizing your financial life, understanding your options, and giving capital a purpose.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://calendly.com/adam-riplwealth/30min" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Book with Adam</a><a class="team-bio-link" href="/team/adam-kasick/">Learn More About Adam <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></article><article><img src="/images/ashton-team-office.png" alt="Ashton Anderson" loading="lazy"/><h3>Ashton Anderson</h3><span class="team-role">Chief of Staff</span><p>The operational architect who helps the firm run with clarity and intention.</p><a class="team-bio-link" href="/team/ashton-anderson/">Learn More About Ashton <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></article><article><img src="/images/tasha-team-office.png" alt="Tasha Skott" loading="lazy"/><h3>Tasha Skott</h3><span class="team-role">Experience Lead</span><p>The standard of care behind every interaction. Thoughtful details and a welcoming experience.</p><a class="team-bio-link" href="/team/tasha-skott/">Learn More About Tasha <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></article></div></div></section><section class="final-cta"><div class="wrap"><h2>Don’t worry about getting everything organized first.</h2><p>Tell us what’s on your mind. We’ll figure out what we actually need from there.</p><a class="btn" href="/contact/">Start the Conversation</a></div></section>
